\n\nよろしくお願いします☺\n\nhttps://x.com/rule_rosePSO2/status/1945536733589725482?s=20", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@inu_daco/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5994e053/uploads/origins/7b04c356-8488-4d73-9b38-b6efbcc66e5b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20f146ce10551ef11615c1986129f1e6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5994e053/uploads/origins/7b04c356-8488-4d73-9b38-b6efbcc66e5b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20f146ce10551ef11615c1986129f1e6, https://si.imgix.net/5994e053/uploads/origins/7b04c356-8488-4d73-9b38-b6efbcc66e5b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bb6fb0ad3b64f1af033ac12faa1a6c26 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5994e053/uploads/origins/7b04c356-8488-4d73-9b38-b6efbcc66e5b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=453ebd92d26b6be3e33c38e290d3f1e7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、いぬだこさん！\n\nアピールをありがとうございます！あなたのスタイルでマゼランを描いていただけたら光栄です。マゼランをあなたのスタイルで描いていただけたら光栄です！🙏\n\n重ね重ね、ご検討ありがとうございました\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_KaEeLK3LZEO3tJPp8LyylwYiA6A7eWL?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@inu_daco/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4de9513d/uploads/origins/b65f2ab4-1fbe-4649-b67e-edfae0306309?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0121b8d3345cbf259d8d6736ee9e9e83", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4de9513d/uploads/origins/b65f2ab4-1fbe-4649-b67e-edfae0306309?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0121b8d3345cbf259d8d6736ee9e9e83, https://si.imgix.net/4de9513d/uploads/origins/b65f2ab4-1fbe-4649-b67e-edfae0306309?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7dd95558518ea0c73d95a06757603e0f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4de9513d/uploads/origins/b65f2ab4-1fbe-4649-b67e-edfae0306309?bg=%23fff&au